{"id":"vod_zy360_67592","vodId":"67592","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"刀剑神域","name_cn":"刀剑神域","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全25集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20241104-1/71e8d221d0fc9b21766a48d7bd694fb4.jpg"},"summary":"2022年，人类实现了现实世界和假想空间的融合，电子制造商开发了名为《刀剑神域（SwordArtOnline）》的在线电子游戏。SAO甫一面世便大受好评，限量一万份的名额在发售当天的短时间内便被抢购一空。通过联网，玩家可以身临其境进入充满想象力和异域风情的游戏世界——浮游城市艾恩葛朗特。玩家在这里可以生活、练武、升级、经商、探险，与真实世界别无二致，却拥有无上的乐趣。曾是少数封测玩家的桐人（松冈祯丞配音）也是这一万名幸运者中的一员。最初的兴奋过后，玩家们却发现根本无法顺利登出游戏，更为恐怖的是，一旦玩家的HP归零，现实世界中他们的肉体也将死亡。他们被SAO的开发者茅场晶彦（山寺宏一配音）困在游戏中，顺利逃脱的方法似乎只有一个，那就是完成困难重重的攻略任务……本片根据川原砾的轻小说改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-11-04 21:25:11","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/C9r3u9VO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/LttZi8Fr/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/qZJG8NOA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/sALx4bAA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/sddDgeFB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/r6RcZwoL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/h6vpd6DH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/0hNrbc8c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/A4kck8V6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/HJ3QFrAO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/5IfwcfgM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/AeX5ntS5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/BINptvm9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/xGKzPiXF/index.m3u8"},{"name":